Subject: [PATCH] feat(assembly): read return data after CALL and CREATE2 in
 the checker with creations

checkCF now accepts RETURNDATASIZE and RETURNDATACOPY in programs that create: segF threads
RdF, the tables' answer for the frame's return data, through every segment, re-established
at each CALL and CREATE2 cut from the frame EthLib's runner returned. Adds the CREATE2
address model of the UniswapV2 factory over a hash with a finite no-collision premise.
